{"title":"Career Roadmap · DevOps Engineer","role":"DevOps Engineer","summary":"A DevOps Engineer builds and maintains the systems that allow software teams to develop, test, deploy, monitor, and operate applications reliably. The role sits between software engineering, cloud infrastructure, automation, security, networking, and operations.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Software Product Engineering (Industry-integrated)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A DevOps Engineer builds and maintains the systems that allow software teams to develop, test, deploy, monitor, and operate applications reliably. The role sits between software engineering, cloud infrastructure, automation, security, networking, and operations."},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Tech/B.E. in Software Product Engineering, DevOps Engineer is a highly aligned career because the industry-integrated curriculum can provide exposure to software development while DevOps adds infrastructure, automation, CI/CD, cloud, containers, and observability."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Linux","Networking","Git","CI/CD","Docker","Kubernetes","Cloud","Infrastructure as Code","Security","Monitoring"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Typical Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Software & Infrastructure Foundation"},{"text":"DevOps Intern → DevOps / Cloud Engineer"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Cloud & Automation"},{"text":"DevOps Engineer → Senior DevOps Engineer"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Platform Engineering"},{"text":"Senior DevOps → Platform / SRE Engineer"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Architecture & Leadership"},{"text":"DevOps Architect / Platform Lead / Cloud Engineering Manager"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Tech","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Programming & Systems Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"DevOps should not be learned as only a collection of tools. Build strong software and systems fundamentals first."},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable with at least one primary language:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Java"},{"text":"Go"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Python is particularly useful for automation, while Go is increasingly common in cloud-native infrastructure."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Functions"},{"text":"Data structures"},{"text":"Exception handling"},{"text":"Modules"},{"text":"Object-oriented programming"},{"text":"File handling"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Basic testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data structures"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Arrays"},{"text":"Strings"},{"text":"Hash maps"},{"text":"Stacks"},{"text":"Queues"},{"text":"Trees"},{"text":"Graph fundamentals"},{"text":"Searching"},{"text":"Sorting"},{"text":"Complexity"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A DevOps engineer does not need competitive-programming depth, but strong programming fundamentals are valuable for automation and troubleshooting."},{"type":"h","text":"Linux Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Linux is a core DevOps skill."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"File systems"},{"text":"Users and groups"},{"text":"Permissions"},{"text":"Processes"},{"text":"Services"},{"text":"Packages"},{"text":"Environment variables"},{"text":"Logs"},{"text":"SSH"},{"text":"Cron"},{"text":"Networking"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important commands:"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"8g3m4p\""},{"type":"p","text":"ls"},{"type":"p","text":"cd"},{"type":"p","text":"cp"},{"type":"p","text":"mv"},{"type":"p","text":"rm"},{"type":"p","text":"mkdir"},{"type":"p","text":"cat"},{"type":"p","text":"grep"},{"type":"p","text":"find"},{"type":"p","text":"chmod"},{"type":"p","text":"chown"},{"type":"p","text":"ps"},{"type":"p","text":"top"},{"type":"p","text":"df"},{"type":"p","text":"du"},{"type":"p","text":"curl"},{"type":"p","text":"wget"},{"type":"p","text":"ssh"},{"type":"p","text":"systemctl"},{"type":"p","text":"journalctl"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to troubleshoot a Linux server without relying entirely on graphical interfaces."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Git, Networking & Software Delivery"},{"type":"h","text":"Git"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Repository"},{"text":"Commit"},{"text":"Branch"},{"text":"Merge"},{"text":"Rebase fundamentals"},{"text":"Pull request"},{"text":"Tags"},{"text":"Remote repositories"},{"text":"Conflict resolution"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand a professional workflow:"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"4y6v1q\""},{"type":"flow","items":["Developer","Git Branch","Commit","Pull Request","Code Review","Merge","CI Pipeline"]},{"type":"p","text":"Use GitHub/GitLab/Bitbucket-style workflows."},{"type":"h","text":"Networking"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OSI/TCP-IP concepts"},{"text":"IP addresses"},{"text":"Subnets"},{"text":"DNS"},{"text":"DHCP"},{"text":"TCP/UDP"},{"text":"HTTP/HTTPS"},{"text":"Ports"},{"text":"NAT"},{"text":"Routing"},{"text":"Load balancing"},{"text":"Firewalls"},{"text":"VPNs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn troubleshooting tools:"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"j7p5c2\""},{"type":"p","text":"ping"},{"type":"p","text":"curl"},{"type":"p","text":"traceroute"},{"type":"p","text":"nslookup"},{"type":"p","text":"dig"},{"type":"p","text":"netstat"},{"type":"p","text":"ss"},{"type":"p","text":"ip"},{"type":"p","text":"Networking becomes particularly important once applications are deployed across cloud environments."},{"type":"h","text":"Web & Application Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how a typical web application works:"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"6m4v8n\""},{"type":"flow","items":["User","DNS","Load Balancer","Web Server","Application","Database","Cache / Storage"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HTTP methods"},{"text":"Status codes"},{"text":"REST APIs"},{"text":"Authentication basics"},{"text":"TLS/HTTPS"},{"text":"Reverse proxies"},{"text":"Application servers"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Caching"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — CI/CD"},{"type":"p","text":"CI/CD is one of the central DevOps concepts."},{"type":"h","text":"Continuous Integration"},{"type":"p","text":"Automatically:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Build"},{"text":"Test"},{"text":"Lint"},{"text":"Scan"},{"text":"Package"}]},{"type":"p","text":"code whenever changes are submitted."},{"type":"h","text":"Continuous Delivery/Deployment"},{"type":"p","text":"Automate deployment to environments such as:"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"4f7c9p\""},{"type":"flow","items":["Development","Testing","Staging","Production"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn one CI/CD platform deeply:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GitHub Actions"},{"text":"GitLab CI/CD"},{"text":"Jenkins"}]},{"type":"p","text":"GitHub Actions is a practical starting point."},{"type":"h","text":"Build Your First Pipeline"},{"type":"p","text":"A basic pipeline should perform:"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"y3c5k7\""},{"type":"flow","items":["Git Push","Checkout","Install Dependencies","Lint","Unit Tests","Build","Security Scan","Create Artifact/Image","Deploy","Smoke Test"]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should understand why each stage exists, not just copy YAML files."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Docker & Containers"},{"type":"p","text":"Containers are fundamental to modern application delivery."},{"type":"h","text":"Docker"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Images"},{"text":"Containers"},{"text":"Dockerfile"},{"text":"Docker Compose"},{"text":"Volumes"},{"text":"Networks"},{"text":"Registries"},{"text":"Environment variables"},{"text":"Container logs"},{"text":"Resource limits"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"0k4t7s\""},{"type":"flow","items":["Source Code","Dockerfile","Docker Image","Container","Application"]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical applications"},{"type":"p","text":"Containerize:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Java Spring Boot application"},{"text":"Python FastAPI application"},{"text":"Node.js application"},{"text":"React frontend"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Kubernetes"},{"type":"p","text":"After Docker, learn Kubernetes fundamentals."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cluster"},{"text":"Node"},{"text":"Pod"},{"text":"Deployment"},{"text":"ReplicaSet"},{"text":"Service"},{"text":"Namespace"},{"text":"ConfigMap"},{"text":"Secret"},{"text":"Ingress"},{"text":"Persistent Volume"},{"text":"StatefulSet basics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Basic architecture:"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"z8q1mb\""},{"type":"flow","items":["Kubernetes Cluster","Nodes","Pods","Containers"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"kubectl"},{"text":"Deployments"},{"text":"Scaling"},{"text":"Rolling updates"},{"text":"Rollbacks"},{"text":"Service discovery"},{"text":"Health checks"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not begin with advanced Kubernetes before understanding Linux, networking, containers, and CI/CD."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Cloud Computing"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one cloud provider as your primary platform."},{"type":"h","text":"AWS"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EC2"},{"text":"VPC"},{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"S3"},{"text":"RDS"},{"text":"Load Balancers"},{"text":"Auto Scaling"},{"text":"CloudWatch"},{"text":"Route 53"},{"text":"ECR"},{"text":"ECS/EKS fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Azure"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Virtual Machines"},{"text":"Virtual Network"},{"text":"Entra ID"},{"text":"Storage"},{"text":"Azure Monitor"},{"text":"Azure Container Services"},{"text":"AKS fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Google Cloud"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compute Engine"},{"text":"VPC"},{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"Cloud Storage"},{"text":"Cloud Monitoring"},{"text":"GKE fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"You can learn the others later. One cloud deeply is better than three clouds superficially."},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud Architecture"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand a basic production architecture:"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"m8x5cd\""},{"type":"flow","items":["Internet","DNS","Load Balancer","Application Servers","Database","Object Storage"]},{"type":"p","text":"Then add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Auto scaling"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Backup"},{"text":"CDN"},{"text":"Secrets"},{"text":"Firewall rules"},{"text":"High availability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Infrastructure as Code"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn Infrastructure as Code so environments can be created consistently."},{"type":"h","text":"Terraform"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Providers"},{"text":"Resources"},{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Outputs"},{"text":"Modules"},{"text":"State"},{"text":"Remote state"},{"text":"Plan"},{"text":"Apply"},{"text":"Destroy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example workflow:"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"6p9k2w\""},{"type":"flow","items":["Terraform Code","terraform plan","Review","terraform apply","Cloud Infrastructure"]},{"type":"p","text":"Terraform should eventually become a core skill."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Observability & Reliability"},{"type":"p","text":"A DevOps engineer is responsible not only for deploying software but also for understanding whether it is working correctly."},{"type":"h","text":"Monitoring"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CPU"},{"text":"Memory"},{"text":"Disk"},{"text":"Network"},{"text":"Application metrics"},{"text":"Request rate"},{"text":"Error rate"},{"text":"Latency"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Logs"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Application logs"},{"text":"System logs"},{"text":"Container logs"},{"text":"Centralized logging"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Traces"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the fundamentals of distributed tracing for applications involving multiple services."},{"type":"h","text":"Observability Stack"},{"type":"p","text":"Gain exposure to tools such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Prometheus"},{"text":"Grafana"},{"text":"OpenTelemetry"},{"text":"ELK/OpenSearch-style logging stacks"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the relationship:"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"q3x7pm\""},{"type":"p","text":"Metrics ──┐"},{"type":"p","text":"Logs ─────┼──→ Observability"},{"type":"p","text":"Traces ───┘"},{"type":"h","text":"Site Reliability Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn basic SRE concepts:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Availability"},{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"SLIs"},{"text":"SLOs"},{"text":"SLAs"},{"text":"Error budgets"},{"text":"Incident management"},{"text":"Postmortems"},{"text":"Capacity planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Incident workflow"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"v6k2rx\""},{"type":"flow","items":["Alert","Detection","Triage","Mitigation","Root Cause","Recovery","Postmortem","Prevent Recurrence"]},{"type":"h","text":"DevSecOps"},{"type":"p","text":"Security should be integrated into the software delivery pipeline."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Secrets management"},{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"Least privilege"},{"text":"Dependency scanning"},{"text":"Container scanning"},{"text":"SAST fundamentals"},{"text":"DAST fundamentals"},{"text":"Infrastructure security"},{"text":"Vulnerability management"},{"text":"Secure CI/CD"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Secure pipeline"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"x4m8qn\""},{"type":"flow","items":["Code","Dependency Scan","SAST","Build","Container Scan","Deploy","Runtime Monitoring"]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Automation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop scripting skills for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Deployment automation"},{"text":"Log processing"},{"text":"Infrastructure management"},{"text":"Backup"},{"text":"Health checks"},{"text":"Cloud operations"},{"text":"Incident response"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Recommended languages:"},{"type":"h","text":"Python + Bash"},{"type":"p","text":"PowerShell can be added for Windows-heavy environments."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Projects"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Complete CI/CD Pipeline"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a production-style application pipeline:"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"9h3m7k\""},{"type":"flow","items":["GitHub","GitHub Actions","Tests","Docker Build","Container Registry","Cloud Deployment","Monitoring"]},{"type":"p","text":"Include automated deployment and rollback."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Kubernetes Deployment"},{"type":"p","text":"Deploy a multi-component application containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Frontend"},{"text":"Backend"},{"text":"Database"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"Kubernetes"},{"text":"Ingress"},{"text":"ConfigMaps"},{"text":"Secrets"},{"text":"Health checks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Infrastructure as Code"},{"type":"p","text":"Use Terraform to create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"VPC/network"},{"text":"Subnets"},{"text":"Security rules"},{"text":"Compute"},{"text":"Load balancer"},{"text":"Database"},{"text":"Storage"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Document the architecture and deployment process."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Observability Platform"},{"type":"p","text":"Build monitoring for a deployed application."},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CPU"},{"text":"Memory"},{"text":"Request count"},{"text":"Error rate"},{"text":"Latency"},{"text":"Application logs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create dashboards with Prometheus + Grafana or an equivalent modern observability stack."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — DevSecOps Pipeline"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"3x9p4v\""},{"type":"flow","items":["Code","Git","CI","Unit Tests","SAST","Dependency Scan","Docker Build","Container Scan","Deploy","Runtime Monitoring"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the strongest portfolio projects for a DevOps candidate."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start applying from the second or third year."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant internships"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DevOps Intern"},{"text":"Cloud Intern"},{"text":"Cloud Engineering Intern"},{"text":"DevSecOps Intern"},{"text":"Site Reliability Engineering Intern"},{"text":"Platform Engineering Intern"},{"text":"Infrastructure Engineering Intern"},{"text":"Backend Engineering Intern with DevOps exposure"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong internship environments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SaaS companies"},{"text":"Product companies"},{"text":"Cloud companies"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"IT services"},{"text":"Startups"},{"text":"Platform engineering teams"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize internships where you actually work with Linux, Git, CI/CD, Docker, cloud infrastructure, monitoring, or automation."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"DevOps"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DevOps Engineer"},{"text":"Junior DevOps Engineer"},{"text":"DevOps Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cloud Engineer"},{"text":"Cloud Support Engineer"},{"text":"Cloud Operations Engineer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Infrastructure"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Infrastructure Engineer"},{"text":"Systems Engineer"},{"text":"Platform Engineer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Reliability"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior SRE"},{"text":"Site Reliability Engineer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Security"},{"type":"p","text":"With additional security knowledge:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DevSecOps Engineer"},{"text":"Cloud Security Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer Requirement","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Source control"},{"text":"Git"}],[{"text":"Build automation"},{"text":"CI/CD"}],[{"text":"Application packaging"},{"text":"Docker"}],[{"text":"Orchestration"},{"text":"Kubernetes"}],[{"text":"Cloud"},{"text":"AWS/Azure/GCP"}],[{"text":"Infrastructure"},{"text":"Terraform"}],[{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"System administration"}],[{"text":"Networking"},{"text":"TCP/IP, DNS, HTTP"}],[{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Prometheus/Grafana"}],[{"text":"Logging"},{"text":"ELK/OpenSearch-style tools"}],[{"text":"Security"},{"text":"DevSecOps"}],[{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Python/Bash"}],[{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"SRE fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Troubleshooting"},{"text":"Systems thinking"}],[{"text":"Collaboration"},{"text":"Git + documentation"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certifications can help validate foundational knowledge, but hands-on projects matter more."},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWS certification path"},{"text":"Microsoft Azure certification path"},{"text":"Google Cloud certification path"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Kubernetes"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Kubernetes-focused training/certification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Terraform"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HashiCorp Terraform certification/training"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Linux"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Linux administration certification/training"}]},{"type":"h","text":"DevOps"},{"type":"p","text":"Vendor-neutral DevOps learning can be useful, but it should supplement actual CI/CD and infrastructure projects."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A PG is not required to become a DevOps Engineer."},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant options include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Tech Computer Science"},{"text":"M.Tech Software Engineering"},{"text":"M.Tech Cloud Computing"},{"text":"M.Tech Distributed Systems"},{"text":"M.Tech Information Technology"},{"text":"M.S. Computer Science"},{"text":"MBA Technology Management — for later management careers"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For entry-level DevOps, practical experience with Linux + Git + CI/CD + Docker + Cloud + Terraform is generally more directly useful than a generic postgraduate qualification."},{"type":"h","text":"Career Specializations"}]},{"heading":"Cloud Engineering","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cloud infrastructure"},{"text":"Networking"},{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"Compute"},{"text":"Storage"},{"text":"Containers"},{"text":"Automation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["DevOps Engineer","Cloud Engineer","Senior Cloud Engineer","Cloud Architect"]}]},{"heading":"Platform Engineering","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Focus on building internal platforms that allow developers to deploy applications easily."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Kubernetes"},{"text":"Internal developer platforms"},{"text":"Developer portals"},{"text":"Infrastructure automation"},{"text":"Self-service deployment"},{"text":"Platform APIs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["DevOps Engineer","Platform Engineer","Senior Platform Engineer","Platform Architect"]}]},{"heading":"Site Reliability Engineering","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"Observability"},{"text":"Incident response"},{"text":"Capacity"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"SLOs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["DevOps Engineer","SRE","Senior SRE","SRE Lead"]}]},{"heading":"DevSecOps","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Focus on integrating security into development and operations."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SAST"},{"text":"DAST"},{"text":"Dependency scanning"},{"text":"Container security"},{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"Secrets management"},{"text":"Cloud security"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["DevOps Engineer","DevSecOps Engineer","Cloud Security Engineer","Security Architect"]}]},{"heading":"Infrastructure Automation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Terraform"},{"text":"Ansible"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Bash"},{"text":"Cloud APIs"},{"text":"Configuration management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is to reduce manual infrastructure operations."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Core DevOps route"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"7w2m9k\""},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech / B.E.","DevOps Intern","Junior DevOps Engineer","DevOps Engineer","Senior DevOps Engineer","DevOps / Platform Lead","DevOps Architect"]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud route"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"5j8x3p\""},{"type":"flow","items":["DevOps Engineer","Cloud Engineer","Senior Cloud Engineer","Cloud Architect","Principal Cloud Architect"]},{"type":"h","text":"SRE route"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"2c6v8n\""},{"type":"flow","items":["DevOps Engineer","SRE","Senior SRE","SRE Lead","Principal SRE / Reliability Architect"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern DevOps is moving toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Platform engineering"},{"text":"Internal developer platforms"},{"text":"GitOps"},{"text":"Kubernetes"},{"text":"Infrastructure as Code"},{"text":"AI-assisted operations"},{"text":"AIOps"},{"text":"Policy as Code"},{"text":"FinOps"},{"text":"Software supply-chain security"},{"text":"OpenTelemetry"},{"text":"Serverless"},{"text":"Cloud-native architectures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Modern delivery model"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"r7p4yx\""},{"type":"flow","items":["Developer","Git","CI","Security Checks","Artifact / Container","GitOps / CD","Kubernetes / Cloud","Observability","Automated Feedback"]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Linux"},{"type":"p","text":"Networking"},{"type":"p","text":"DNS"},{"type":"p","text":"HTTP/HTTPS"},{"type":"p","text":"Security Fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Bash"},{"type":"p","text":"Git"},{"type":"p","text":"REST APIs"},{"type":"p","text":"Testing Fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"DevOps"},{"type":"p","text":"CI/CD"},{"type":"p","text":"Docker"},{"type":"p","text":"Kubernetes"},{"type":"p","text":"Terraform"},{"type":"p","text":"Infrastructure as Code"},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"p","text":"AWS / Azure / GCP"},{"type":"p","text":"IAM"},{"type":"p","text":"Networking"},{"type":"p","text":"Compute"},{"type":"p","text":"Storage"},{"type":"p","text":"Databases"},{"type":"p","text":"Containers"},{"type":"h","text":"Observability"},{"type":"p","text":"Prometheus"},{"type":"p","text":"Grafana"},{"type":"p","text":"OpenTelemetry"},{"type":"p","text":"Logging"},{"type":"p","text":"Tracing"},{"type":"p","text":"Alerting"},{"type":"h","text":"Security"},{"type":"p","text":"IAM"},{"type":"p","text":"Secrets"},{"type":"p","text":"SAST"},{"type":"p","text":"Dependency Scanning"},{"type":"p","text":"Container Security"},{"type":"p","text":"Cloud Security"},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"GitOps"},{"type":"p","text":"Platform Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"AIOps"},{"type":"p","text":"FinOps"},{"type":"p","text":"Policy as Code"},{"type":"p","text":"Distributed Systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to take a basic application from source code to monitored cloud deployment:"},{"type":"p","text":"id=\"5s7x2m\""},{"type":"flow","items":["Application Code","Git Repository","Automated Tests","CI Pipeline","Docker Image","Container Registry","Terraform Infrastructure","Cloud / Kubernetes","Automated Deployment","Monitoring + Logs","Alerts","Incident Response"]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should ideally graduate with one DevOps/cloud internship, strong Linux and networking fundamentals, Git proficiency, a complete CI/CD project, Docker/Kubernetes exposure, Terraform experience, cloud deployment experience, and an observability/security project."},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Tech/B.E. Software Product Engineering → DevOps Engineer is a strong modern engineering pathway because it combines software development with infrastructure and cloud engineering."},{"type":"p","text":"The core employability combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Linux","Networking","Git","CI/CD","Docker","Cloud","Terraform","Kubernetes","Monitoring","Security."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For long-term growth, the student should avoid becoming only a pipeline-maintenance specialist. The stronger direction is to understand distributed systems, cloud architecture, reliability, automation, security, and developer platforms."},{"type":"p","text":"The most future-ready progression is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["DevOps Engineer","Senior DevOps Engineer","Platform/SRE/Cloud Specialist","DevOps Architect / Platform Lead","Principal Engineer or Engineering Manager"]}]}]}